{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/dabeda39944e9d867c7b88912b5c739e.avif?t=1774049553\" width=462 height=174 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hold Your King is a physics-based co-op platformer set in a stylized medieval world full of parkours, dangers, and coordination. Trust your friend and carry the king to the throne room.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DON'T LOSE YOUR BALANCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Beware the physics while carrying the King! Your speed, acceleration, and angular momentum directly affect his balance. Every step you take decides the King\u2019s fate\u2014and therefore yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/37bb972b034e927c69721cd769c20a7c.poster.avif?t=1774049553\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/37bb972b034e927c69721cd769c20a7c.webm?t=1774049553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/37bb972b034e927c69721cd769c20a7c.mp4?t=1774049553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MAKE USE OF YOUR LIMBS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Keeping the King balanced is up to you! Lift the stretcher up or down, rotate it left or right, and use physics to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/720096bb8ad7b887897cf18accc7d6b0.poster.avif?t=1774049553\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/720096bb8ad7b887897cf18accc7d6b0.webm?t=1774049553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/720096bb8ad7b887897cf18accc7d6b0.mp4?t=1774049553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BONK THE KING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bonk the King to steady him\u2014but he might get angry. Do it at your own risk!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/2eff708d96d74b7bc4991a7507f2f90d.poster.avif?t=1774049553\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/2eff708d96d74b7bc4991a7507f2f90d.webm?t=1774049553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/2eff708d96d74b7bc4991a7507f2f90d.mp4?t=1774049553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>INTERACT WITH KING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">King is responsive to his environment, you can manipulate him as you wish. You could be a bit kinder, though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/9f72197d9fd5ff7e989a1499fc403ce5.poster.avif?t=1774049553\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/9f72197d9fd5ff7e989a1499fc403ce5.webm?t=1774049553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/9f72197d9fd5ff7e989a1499fc403ce5.mp4?t=1774049553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DO NOT ANGER THE KING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Or be ready for whips and tantrums.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/829cbd4b5a27dc0c91520433043161c2.poster.avif?t=1774049553\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/829cbd4b5a27dc0c91520433043161c2.webm?t=1774049553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/829cbd4b5a27dc0c91520433043161c2.mp4?t=1774049553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HOLD YOUR KING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pick up the King and drag him back onto the stretcher. Simple? Think again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/c9be87aafd683376ce4b47a3e3db3557.poster.avif?t=1774049553\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/c9be87aafd683376ce4b47a3e3db3557.webm?t=1774049553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/c9be87aafd683376ce4b47a3e3db3557.mp4?t=1774049553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>USE THE STRETCHER TO CLEAR YOUR PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use the stretcher to interact with dynamic obstacles and clear your path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/29ecf8e727490bcf86a67ee71fad41bb.poster.avif?t=1774049553\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/29ecf8e727490bcf86a67ee71fad41bb.webm?t=1774049553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/extras/29ecf8e727490bcf86a67ee71fad41bb.mp4?t=1774049553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564340?t=1774049553","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/a260feaf8d8bea5719b6fbe34c63f468fc3d33f2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774049553","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/654917dbef21b13ec78ce669f95af9d874e0ee46/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774049553","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564340/654917dbef21b13ec78ce669f95af9d874e0ee46/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774049553","categories":[{